      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Some adventurers\u2019 skills have upgraded versions, which are indicated
        by a gray arrow.\nAfter clearing specific quests, these skills will automatically
        be upgraded,\nthen they'll be indicated by an <color=orange>orange arrow</color>.\nYou
        can view the condition of upgrading a skill by viewing its skill details
        menu."
